      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10647333::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC10647333::web::018::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 0.5 atomic % Hf will improve both room-temperature tensile strength and ductility.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10647333::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC10647333::web::018::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf addition will produce Hf-rich precipitates at internal boundaries of the lamellar colonies.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10647333::web::018::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf-rich precipitates will be localized at phase and grain boundaries within the lamellar colonies.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10647333::web::018::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Trace Hf will form fine intermetallic precipitates at colony boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10647333::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC10647333::web::018::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boundary-localized Hf-rich precipitates will strengthen or pin the interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10647333::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC10647333::web::018::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interface pinning by Hf-rich precipitates will inhibit room-temperature microcrack nucleation and propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf-rich precipitates will provide precipitation strengthening within the harder phase.",
